 R←Test_ListIssues_020(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;filename;html
⍝ Regression test: -html must win over -verbose.
⍝ With both specified the verbose branch used to win, so no HTML was created at all.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 stop←0
 (rc msg filename)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''Tatin'' -html -verbose'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢⍴filename         ⍝ A matrix would mean -verbose won
 →T.GoToTidyUp~⎕NEXISTS filename
 html←⊃⎕NGET filename 1
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'<!DOCTYPE html>')∊html

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 :If 1=≢⍴filename
     {}##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile filename
 :EndIf
⍝Done
